# Wrangler local secrets stub (loaded by `wrangler dev`).
#
# Real secrets for production are managed via `wrangler secret put`.
# Do NOT commit a real .dev.vars file.
#
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and replace placeholders before running
# `wrangler dev`. 0.1.0 Foundation has no bindings that require
# secrets; this stub exists so the .gitignore whitelist (`!.dev.vars.example`)
# is satisfied.

# Example placeholder (none used by 0.1.0 Foundation release):
# SOME_BINDING_TOKEN="replace-me"